# Copy to secrets.auto.tfvars (gitignored) ONLY if you prefer tfvars over
# SSM for a local plan. The committed configuration expects all secrets in
# SSM Parameter Store:
#
#   /balashikshana/staging/db_master_password   (SecureString, pre-created)
#   /balashikshana/staging/smtp_user            (SecureString, pre-created)
#   /balashikshana/staging/smtp_pass            (SecureString, pre-created)
#   /balashikshana/staging/database_url         (SecureString, managed by Terraform)
#
# This example intentionally contains NO real values; the secret-scan test
# treats literal secret assignments as a failure.
